<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USF&amp;G Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USF&amp;G Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its rating on USF&amp;G Corp to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- USF&amp;G gained 1/8 to 20-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
